<title>ALBANIA: Albanian copper output falls in second quarter.</title>
<headline>Albanian copper output falls in second quarter.</headline>
<dateline>TIRANA 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Albania's Institute of Statistics reported the following main economic indicators on Wednesday -</p>
<p> ALBANIAN COPPER OUTPUT	     1996 Q2    1995 Q2    Change</p>
<p> Copper ore (tonnes)		   51,953    77,000   -25,047</p>
<p> Copper concentrates (tonnes)	 3,606     6,000    -2,394</p>
<p> Blister copper (tonnes)		  741	 900	-159</p>
<p> Copper cables, wires (tonnes)	   58	 100	 -42</p>
<p>-- Tirana Newsroom +355 42 62228</p>
</text>
